# Directory spec for the `server` crate: the diagnostic API. Submodules are specified by
# nearer same-basename specs.

Spec: server

Platform: Rust/Kubernetes

Purpose:
  The diagnostic HTTP API (`vynil-server`). It exposes cluster package/instance state to
  `kubectl-vynil` and dashboards: authentication, authorization, discovery, log and event
  collection, and DTO serialization, with tenant-scoped access and payload anonymization.

Structure:
  ./src/main.rs: Entrypoint, rustls provider pin, server bootstrap
  ./src/lib.rs: Library root declaring the API modules
  ./src/server.rs: Axum router and endpoint wiring
  ./src/auth.rs: Request authentication
  ./src/authz.rs: Tenant-scoped authorization
  ./src/discovery.rs: Package and instance discovery
  ./src/collect/: Log and event collection
  ./src/dto.rs: Response DTOs
  ./src/error.rs: API `@Error` mapping
  ./src/anonymize.rs: Tenant payload anonymization
  ./src/config.rs: Server configuration
  ./src/state.rs: Shared `@AppState`
  ./parent.toml: Standalone workspace manifest for the image build (generated)
  ./Dockerfile: Runtime image build (contract in ./Dockerfile.sdd)

Owns:
  ./src/main.rs
  ./src/lib.rs
  ./src/server.rs
  ./src/auth.rs
  ./src/authz.rs
  ./src/discovery.rs
  ./src/dto.rs
  ./src/error.rs
  ./src/anonymize.rs
  ./src/config.rs
  ./src/state.rs
  ./Cargo.toml
  ./parent.toml

Must:
  Authorize every read against the requesting tenant scope before returning cluster data.
  Anonymize secrets in returned payloads.
  Pin the rustls crypto provider to `ring` before the Kubernetes client is built.

Must not:
  Enforce package lifecycle rules; reconciliation belongs to the `operator` crate.
  Depend on the `agent` or `operator` crates.

Depends on:
  ./common/common.sdd
  `axum`, `kube`, `k8s-openapi`

Done when:
  Each API module has a reviewed spec and `cargo test -p server` is green.

Tasks:
  [x] #0 Spec `./src/authz.rs` and `./src/collect/`.
  [x] #1 Spec `./src/discovery.rs`, `./src/anonymize.rs`, and `./src/dto.rs`.

References:
  ./src/main.sdd, ./src/lib.sdd, ./src/server.sdd, ./src/auth.sdd, ./src/authz.sdd,
    ./src/discovery.sdd, ./src/dto.sdd, ./src/error.sdd, ./src/anonymize.sdd,
    ./src/config.sdd, ./src/state.sdd, ./src/collect/children.sdd,
    ./src/collect/clusterinfo.sdd, ./src/collect/logs.sdd, ./src/collect/packages.sdd,
    ./src/collect/popularity_contest.sdd, ./src/collect/state.sdd,
    ./src/collect/vynilconfig.sdd — the file-level contracts; this directory spec stays
    coarse and defers all file behavior to them. `./src/collect/mod.rs` is a re-export
    shim with no behavior and carries no file spec per `.specdd/bootstrap.project.md`.
